## Business Model

CloudCart operates using a Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) subscription model.

Customers subscribe to monthly or annual plans to access the cloud-hosted platform.

Revenue is generated through recurring subscriptions while CloudCart is responsible for:

- Application maintenance
- Cloud infrastructure
- Security
- Software updates
- Customer support

